newaqemu — authors and maintainers
==================================

newaqemu (this fork)
--------------------

James "Jim" Ed Randson <jimedrand@disroot.org>
    Maintainer (2026–present)
    Qt6 / C++17 port, hybrid QEMU/libvirt backends, GPU passthrough
    host integration, Windows build, legacy AQEMU import


AQEMU (upstream)
----------------

Andrey Rijov <ANDron142@yandex.ru>
    Original author of AQEMU (2008–2010)

Tobias Gläßer
    AQEMU maintainer and developer (from 0.9.0 through 0.9.2)


Notable AQEMU contributors
--------------------------

The following people contributed patches, packaging, translations, or
other work that remains in this codebase. See src/About_Window.cpp and
CHANGELOG for additional names and credits.

